<title>UK: Sbs-Agro adds $50 mln to three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sbs-Agro adds $50 mln to three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to $250 million from $200 million, lead manager J.P.</p>
<p>Morgan said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBS-AGRO FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SBS-AGRO</p>
<p> AMT  * $250 MLN	COUPON     10.25     MATURITY    21.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.446    PAY DATE    21.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.446    SPREAD	+420 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  RUSSIA    TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT MAY 2000 U.S.T  NOTES	**US/UK/RUSSIA/NETHERLANDS</p>
<p>	    * ORIGINAL $200 MLN LAUNCHED 08.JUL AT 99.25, +425 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
